namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamRichTextBlock {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock
    src   "A rich text block whose hierarchy is code, not an asset: one paragraph that reads markup.\n\nUMG's RichTextBlock resolves `<Tag>text</Tag>` against a decorator set; this library's text stack\nhas had the same idea since it was written -- UDreamText::bRichText plus two data assets, one\nmapping tags to styles and one mapping tags to images -- and what was missing was a CONTROL that\nturns it on. That is all this class is: a text node with the flag set, the two assets exposed, and\nthe colour and size coming from the project sheet like every other control's.\n\nWHY IT IS A CONTROL AND NOT A FLAG ON A TEXT NODE\n-------------------------------------------------\nThe flag already exists on the node, and an author who wants it there can still set it. What a\ncontrol adds is the thing a flag cannot: a `Native.RichText` tag that reads the project's text\ncolour and size, so a project restyles its prose in one place, and a place for the two data assets\nto be authored per instance without anyone reaching into a visual.\n\nWHAT THE MARKUP MEANS is not this control's business and is not restated here -- the tag\nvocabulary, the filter flags and the two asset formats belong to UDreamText and its parser, and a\nsecond description of them in a control header is a second thing to keep true."
    text  "一种富文本块，其层级是代码而非资产：只需一个段落即可读取标记。\n\nUMG 的 RichTextBlock 依据装饰器集合解析 `<Tag>text</Tag>`；本库的文本栈\n自编写之初就有同样的思路——UDreamText::bRichText 外加两个数据资产，一个\n把标签映射到样式，一个把标签映射到图像——所缺的只是一个能将其开启的控件。\n这个类不过如此：一个设置了该标志的文本节点，两个资产对外暴露，\n颜色和大小与其他控件一样取自项目表。\n\n为什么它是控件，而不是文本节点上的一个标志\n-------------------------------------------------\n该标志在节点上本就存在，想要如此的使用者仍然可以设置它。控件所增加的，\n是标志做不到的事：一个读取项目文本颜色和大小的 `Native.RichText` 标签，\n使项目能在一处重新设定其正文的样式；以及一个位置，让两个数据资产\n可以按实例分别编辑，而无需任何人深入某个可视对象。\n\n标记的含义不归本控件管，此处也不重述——标签词汇、\n过滤标志和两种资产格式属于 UDreamText 及其解析器，\n而在控件头文件中再写一遍它们的说明，就是多出一件需要保持一致的事。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:bAutoWrapText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:bAutoWrapText
    src   "Break a line that does not fit rather than letting it run on -- UMG's AutoWrapText.\n\nOff by default, which is the paragraph's own default and therefore what every existing block\ndoes. It only bites under the overflow types that do NOT already wrap: VerticalOverflow always\nwraps, so a block left on the shipped overflow will not notice this either way."
    text  "放不下的行就换行，而不是让它继续延伸——即 UMG 的 AutoWrapText。\n\n默认关闭，这也是段落自身的默认值，因此现有的每个块都是如此。它只在那些本身不换行的溢出类型下才起作用：\nVerticalOverflow 总会换行，所以沿用默认溢出的块\n无论如何都不会察觉它的存在。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:CustomStyleData {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:CustomStyleData
    src   "What `<MyTag>` means, as a style. Null leaves custom tags to the char-selection consumers."
    text  "`<MyTag>text</MyTag>` 作为样式所表示的含义。为空时，自定义标签交由字符选择的使用方处理。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:GetDefaultDynamicMaterial {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:GetDefaultDynamicMaterial
    src   "A material instance of this block's own, created over the style's material the first time it\nis asked for -- UMG's GetDefaultDynamicMaterial.\n\nReturns null when the style names no material: there is nothing to instance, and handing back\nan instance of the library's built-in text material would let a caller edit every other\nparagraph in the project through it."
    text  "此块自有的材质实例，在首次请求时基于样式的材质创建——\n即 UMG 的 GetDefaultDynamicMaterial。\n\n当样式未指定材质时返回空值：没有任何东西可供实例化，而返回\n库内置文本材质的实例，会让调用方通过它改动项目中的其他所有\n段落。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:GetDefaultFont {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:GetDefaultFont
    src   "The DEFAULT typeface for undecorated prose -- UMG's SetDefaultFont, minus what FSlateFontInfo\npacks in beside it: the size is Style.FontSize and the outline is Style.TextStyle. Markup may\nstill switch the face per run; this is what a run that says nothing gets.\n\nReads and writes Style.Font, so it obeys StyleSource like the rest of the look. Null means\n\"leave the paragraph on the font it has\", which is every block that exists today."
    text  "未加装饰的正文所用的默认字体——即 UMG 的 SetDefaultFont，但不含 FSlateFontInfo 额外打包的内容：\n大小取自 Style.FontSize，描边取自 Style.TextStyle。标记仍可按文本段切换字体；\n此处是未作任何声明的文本段所得到的字体。\n\n读写 Style.Font，因此与外观的其他部分一样遵循 StyleSource。为空表示“让段落保持它当前的字体”，\n现有每个块都是如此。"
    state machine
}

