DreamRichTextBlock:ImageData {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:ImageData
    src   "What `<img=key/>` means. Null draws nothing for an image tag. The tag may also give a size and where the image sits\non its line: `<img=key,24/>`, `<img=key,24,32/>`, `<img=key,24,baseline/>` -- middle (the default, centred), baseline,\ntop or bottom. An image taller than its line makes the line taller."
    text  "`<img=key/>` 的含义。为空时，图像标签不绘制任何内容。该标签还可以给出尺寸以及图像在其行上的位置：\n`<img=key,24/>`、`<img=key,24,32/>`、`<img=key,24,baseline/>`——middle（默认，居中）、baseline、\ntop 或 bottom。图像高于其所在行时，该行会被撑高。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:Language {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:Language
    src   "The language the prose is written in, as a culture name (\"ja\", \"zh-Hans\"); empty is the game's. Picks the font's\nfallbacks meant for it and the forms a script draws per language -- see UDreamText::Language. `<lang=xx>` still\noverrides it for what the tag encloses."
    text  "正文所使用的语言，以文化名表示（\"ja\"、\"zh-Hans\"）；为空则使用游戏的。用于挑选为该语言准备的字体\n回退，以及文字系统按语言绘制的字形——参见 UDreamText::Language。`<lang=xx>文本</lang>` 仍\n会对其所包围的内容覆盖此设置。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:LastLineAlign {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:LastLineAlign
    src   "How a justified paragraph's last line, and a line a newline ends, align. Read only with HorizontalAlignment Justify."
    text  "两端对齐段落的最后一行，以及由换行符结束的行，如何对齐。仅在 HorizontalAlignment 为 Justify 时读取。"
