}

DreamRichTextBlock:MinDesiredWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:MinDesiredWidth
    src   "A floor under the width the paragraph asks a content-sized parent for -- UMG's MinDesiredWidth.\nZero means no opinion, which is every block that exists today."
    text  "段落向按内容调整大小的父级所请求宽度的下限——即 UMG 的 MinDesiredWidth。\n零表示不发表意见，现有每个块都是如此。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextBlock:OverflowType {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRichTextBlock.h#DreamRichTextBlock:OverflowType
    src   "What a line too long for the control does. VerticalOverflow is the one that WRAPS, which is\nwhat prose usually wants and what a rich text block almost always is."
